{"id":"msg-7769574356233580139","ts":1791714999000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"死神的面貌在历史长河中变得越来越狰狞，人的演习也越来越采取凶残的形式，但人只要敢于确定必死的前提，就可以将迷宫的游戏玩下去。在旅途中，我的眼睛渐渐变成了死人的眼睛，","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574356233580139\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:39</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\"> 死神的面貌在历史长河中变得越来越狰狞，人的演习也越来越采取凶残的形式，但人只要敢于确定必死的前提，就可以将迷宫的游戏玩下去。在旅途中，我的眼睛渐渐变成了死人的眼睛，</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"},
{"id":"msg-7769574356233580140","ts":1791714999000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"阿门阿前一棵葡萄树，\n阿嫩阿嫩绿地刚发芽。\n蜗牛背着那重重的壳呀，\n一步一步地往上爬。\n阿树阿上两只黄鹂鸟，\n阿嘻阿嘻哈哈在笑它。\n葡萄成熟还早得很哪，\n现在上来干什么？\n阿黄阿黄鹂儿不要笑，\n等我爬上它就成熟了！","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574356233580140\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:39</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\">阿门阿前一棵葡萄树，\n阿嫩阿嫩绿地刚发芽。\n蜗牛背着那重重的壳呀，\n一步一步地往上爬。\n阿树阿上两只黄鹂鸟，\n阿嘻阿嘻哈哈在笑它。\n葡萄成熟还早得很哪，\n现在上来干什么？\n阿黄阿黄鹂儿不要笑，\n等我爬上它就成熟了！</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"},
{"id":"msg-7769574356233580141","ts":1791715000000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"到底誰家還有媽讓我操逼","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574356233580141\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:40</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\">到底誰家還有媽讓我操逼</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"},
{"id":"msg-7769574356233580142","ts":1791715000000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"豆包帮我生成一个天天黏着我给我发消息给我报备离开我一分钟就会死的小男孩（我看红果的时候不要发消息）","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574356233580142\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:40</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\">豆包帮我生成一个天天黏着我给我发消息给我报备离开我一分钟就会死的小男孩（我看红果的时候不要发消息）</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"},
{"id":"msg-7769574356233580143","ts":1791715001000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"我感知到圆柱体登顶所需的阻力，是由成瘾、痛苦、负面情绪以及克服它们的意志构成的。","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574356233580143\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:41</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\">我感知到圆柱体登顶所需的阻力，是由成瘾、痛苦、负面情绪以及克服它们的意志构成的。</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"},
{"id":"msg-7769574356233580144","ts":1791715001000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"1934年6月，他在湘鄂西中央分局会议上承认肃反扩大化的错误，10月红三军与任弼时红六军团会师后，他对所犯的错误作了检查，不久被任命为湘鄂川黔省委委员、军分会委员和革命委员会副主席、红六军团政治部主任，1935年11月参加长征。\n1936年2月28日，在毕节渡河时夏曦因身体疲倦而失足落水；因杀人过多，身边的红军对其恨之入骨，对其落水视若无睹、袖手旁观，夏曦因而失救溺毙[9]。","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574356233580144\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:41</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\">1934年6月，他在湘鄂西中央分局会议上承认肃反扩大化的错误，10月红三军与任弼时红六军团会师后，他对所犯的错误作了检查，不久被任命为湘鄂川黔省委委员、军分会委员和革命委员会副主席、红六军团政治部主任，1935年11月参加长征。\n1936年2月28日，在毕节渡河时夏曦因身体疲倦而失足落水；因杀人过多，身边的红军对其恨之入骨，对其落水视若无睹、袖手旁观，夏曦因而失救溺毙[9]。</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"},
{"id":"msg-7769574437469401125","ts":1791715018000,"date":"2026-10-11","uid":"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw","name":"Lovercraft 腹語術","nameLower":"lovercraft 腹語術","text":"禅下平坦的垂类。","textTruncated":false,"html":"\n        <div class=\"message-block\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\">\n            \n            <div class=\"message self\" data-date=\"2026-10-11\" data-sender-uid=\"u_YadZ4lIUA1SG4xqn-bjEWw\" id=\"msg-7769574437469401125\">\n                <div class=\"avatar\"><img src=\"http://q.qlogo.cn/g?b=qq&nk=2591607377&s=100\" alt=\"Lovercraft 腹語術\" onerror=\"this.style.display='none'; this.nextSibling.style.display='inline-flex';\" />\n                    <span class=\"avatar-fallback\" style=\"display:none; background:hsl(278 58% 48%);\">L</span></div>\n                <div class=\"message-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"message-header\">\n                        <span class=\"sender\">Lovercraft 腹語術</span>\n                        <span class=\"time\">2026/10/11 18:36:58</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"message-bubble\">\n                        <div class=\"content\"><span class=\"text-content\">禅下平坦的垂类。</span></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>"}
